  "id": "binocular-rivalry",
  "term": "binocular rivalry",
  "definition": "Binocular rivalry is a visual perception phenomenon in which awareness alternates between different images when conflicting stimuli are shown separately to each eye. It is understood as a way the visual system handles mismatched input from the two eyes.",
